<title>USA: Market Facts cannot account for stock rise.</title>
<headline>Market Facts cannot account for stock rise.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market Facts Inc said Tuesday it knows of no specific reason for the sharp rise in its stock.</p>
<p>&quot;We're delighted, but can't attribute it to anything specific,&quot; a company spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>Market Facts' stock was at 40-1/2, up 6 on 24,100 shares.</p>
<p>The company does custom market research for large marketers of products and services throughout the United States.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
